  (b) Write a python code. Accept a paragraph from the user.
Perform the following tasks.
•	Count total words 
•	Count unique words 
•	Find the frequency of every word 
•	Display the most frequent word 
•	Display words appearing only once 

ANSWER

text = input("Enter paragraph: ")

words = text.lower().split()

print("Total:", len(words))
print("Unique:", len(set(words)))

freq = {}

for w in words:
    freq[w] = words.count(w)

print("Frequency:", freq)

print("Most frequent:", max(freq, key=freq.get))

print("Once:")
for w in freq:
    if freq[w] == 1:
        print(w)

print("Alphabetical:", sorted(words))

